Package: rlearn
Title: Talk to Claude About Your Code, One Function at a Time
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R-learn-plugin", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "tgberna@sandia.gov")
Description: Adds a 'claude' chunk type to R Markdown and a few 'RStudio'
    add-ins. You write a function (or an English description of one) in an R
    chunk, ask a question in a 'claude' chunk below it, and Claude's answer is
    written into the notebook underneath. Claude sees your code and its output,
    and is instructed to explain every piece of code it suggests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    evaluate,
    httr2,
    knitr (>= 1.35),
    rstudioapi,
    yaml
Suggests:
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
